5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We should ensure our new system fosters warmth and peace. I suggest we look at how others handle this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I want to make sure we don't let money create tension between us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if some people are paying more than others right now. I want to know the truth.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We need to be practical. I want to see the actual costs and what changes might cost us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just hope the new way isn't too difficult to manage every month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
