35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems a fixed rate allows people to relax, though some may still fear the cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The logs show we've had many late payments and arguments over the amounts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that some rooms use four times more power than others!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills swing wildly between summer and winter. Also, meters are quite expensive to install.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The templates and other houses... they seem to take a lot of time and effort to manage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, that explains why some of us feel the cold more than others.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, if the bills vary that much, no wonder people are stressed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, is the electrician's quote too high for us to afford?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"It's 34,000 yen per room. That's a huge upfront cost for us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't want to spend hours every month on spreadsheets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must avoid a system that makes us calculate every flick of a switch.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I agree. We need something simple that doesn't cause fights.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"But if one person uses four times more, is it fair to split it equally?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"Fairness is one thing, but the cost of meters might be worse than the imbalance.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Maybe a simple split is best, even if it's not perfect?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what options we have to balance fairness and peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I just want us to stop avoiding each other over money.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I still feel bad if someone is carrying my cost, or vice versa.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,We need a way to handle those winter spikes without it feeling like second rent.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,As long as it's not a monthly nightmare to calculate.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
